Tue Oct 27 00:00:00 UTC 2026 - Luci <radu4cristian1@gmail.com>

- Run every source service on the server: buildtime services pulled
  obs-service-* into the Fedora build roots, where their dependencies
  are ambiguous and the build never started
- Build on Fedora: Ninja, systemd-rpm-macros and the plain cmake build
  and install macros; udev is reloaded by Fedora's own file trigger
- Build for Debian too, from sonero.dsc and the debian.* files
- Build for Arch too, from PKGBUILD
- No rnnoise on i586: Slowroll does not build it there

